Z||000009||batboy||08-15-99||10:11 PM||||Some of the guys are a little touchy about Hondas. They're a Fiero's arch enemy. Biggguy, if you think that Supra spoiler will look good to you, then do it. We are all individualist to some degree.<p>For handling, consider using poly control arm bushings. For engine performance, a number of folks here have stroked the 2.8 into a 3.1 liter engine (3.2 if you bore it out too). <br>Add either a GM hi-po cam or the Crane Compucam and a nice set of headers for proven performance gains. A bit of pocket porting on the heads are nice if you can find a shop that knows what they're doing.
Z||000010||DJRice||08-16-99||07:20 AM||||If the picture you want to post is already on the web, then all you have to do is follow the instructions on the page UBB code page.  <p>When you post a message, you will see the two buttons below the text box and the following  red text string below that:   <p>"If HTML and/or UBB Code are enabled, this means you can use use HTML and/or UBB Code in your message."<p>You will notice that the "UBB Code" is underlined.  Click on it. It will have instructions for doing several things in your messages.<p>Keep in mind that your picture already has to be posted on the web.
